_ do store-viewed
    - cell Operand
    - field LayoutField
    - value Operand
    - syntax SyntaxId

` Stores a value where a view's item lies: a struct by a copy, and a managed pointer through
` the write barrier.
if tables.layouts.is-struct(field.layout)
    store-struct(cell, field, value, syntax)
else if field.layout != void-layout
    store(cell, field.offset, value, is-managed-pointer(field.layout), syntax)

