    - id
    - item-layout
    - snapshot
    - stride
    - part(source, source-layout, 0, id).operand
    - part(source, source-layout, 1, id).operand
    - length.operand
copy-items
    - id
    - item-layout
    - part(spanned.operand, layout, 0, id).operand
    - part(spanned.operand, layout, 1, id).operand
    - snapshot
    - stride
    - length.operand

